  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One chain, one closure",
      "items": [
        "Five orchestrators in order: design → spec-writer → plan → dev → close; report stands outside the chain",
        "Each one presents its artifact and stops for the author's explicit approval before its first dispatch",
        "The handoff is the engine's next: line — a converged artifact moves on, a blocked one does not"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "One target vocabulary",
      "items": [
        "--type takes the document or node shape the artifact declares: phase-spec · overall · plan · single-spec · wave · branch",
        "The old --type spec spelling is retired — the enum refuses it",
        "The doc-contract gate judges every document shape by its declared doc-type: key, not by the command's --type"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Gates before dispatch",
      "items": [
        "tree-clean → in-flight → graph → plan-ledger → wave → doc-contract, in that order, on every work command",
        "A plan's wave is at most three tasks wide; the engine refuses a wider wave instead of splitting it",
        "A second dispatch in the same tree is refused until the in-flight holder is gone, and --steal-stale is the only takeover"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What the engine leaves behind",
      "items": [
        "A round record per dispatch: the baseline HEAD, a terminal verdict, the graded violations, the carrier path",
        "Each child's own output lands in .kairos/cdd/<slug>/logs/ and a blocked run names that file on stderr",
        "next: closes the run as its last line, and cdd board renders the same judgment from the ledger"
      ]
    }
  ]
